.TH SKYCHAT 1 "2026" "skychat-tui" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
skychat \- terminal client for skych.at
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B skychat
[\fIusername\fR [\fIpassword\fR]]
[\fB\-\-debug\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B skychat
is a curses-based terminal client for the SkyChat chat service at
.IR skych.at .
It provides a three-panel layout with a channel list, chat view, and user list,
and supports inline image preview via Kitty, Sixel, or libcaca protocols.
.PP
Without arguments, an interactive login screen is shown with the username
pre-filled from the saved config if available. Credentials can also be passed
directly on the command line to skip the login screen.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.I username
Username to log in with. If omitted, the login screen is shown.
.TP
.I password
Password to log in with. Required if \fIusername\fR is given.
.TP
.B \-\-debug
Write crash tracebacks to
.I /tmp/skychat_crash.log
instead of silently exiting.
.SH LAYOUT
.PP
The interface is divided into three vertical panels:
.PP
.nf
┌──────────┬─────────────────────────┬──────────┐
│ Channels │      Chat messages      │  Users   │
│          ├─────────────────────────┤          │
│          │    Input box            │          │
└──────────┴─────────────────────────┴──────────┘
.fi
.PP
.B Tab
cycles focus between panels. The active panel is indicated by a
.B ▶
in its title.
.SH KEYS
.SS Navigation
.TP
.BR Tab / Shift+Tab
Cycle focus: Input \(-> Rooms \(-> Users \(-> Input.
.TP
.BR \(ua / \(da " (Rooms focus)"
Move room cursor.
.TP
.BR Enter " (Rooms focus)"
Join selected room.
.TP
.BR Backspace " (Rooms focus)"
Leave selected DM or private room.
.TP
.BR \(ua / \(da " (Users focus)"
Move user cursor.
.TP
.BR Enter " (Users focus)"
Open DM with selected user.
.SS Messages (Input focus)
.TP
.BR \(ua / \(da
Enter scroll mode and move message selection.
.TP
.B Shift+\(ua
Scroll up 5 messages.
.TP
.B Shift+\(da
Snap back to the bottom.
.TP
.BR Space " (while scrolled)"
Quote selected message \(em prefills
.B @<id>
in the input box.
.TP
.BR e " (while scrolled)"
Edit selected message (own messages only).
.TP
.BR Backspace " (while scrolled)"
Delete selected message (own messages only).
.TP
.BR < " / " >  " (while scrolled)"
Cycle between URLs and buttons in the selected message.
.TP
.BR o " (while scrolled)"
Open focused URL in browser or activate focused button.
.TP
.B Esc
Close image preview if open (then open menu), otherwise toggle menu.
.SS Input Editing
.TP
.BR \(la / \(ra
Move cursor left or right.
.TP
.BR Home / End
Jump to start or end of input.
.TP
.BR Backspace / Del
Delete character.
.TP
.B Enter
Send message.
.PP
Multi-line messages can be composed with
.BR Alt+Enter " or " Shift+Enter .
The input box grows up to 5 lines and shrinks back after sending.
Lines beginning with
.B >
are rendered as greentext.
.SS Image Preview
.PP
When a message is selected in scroll mode and the focused link is an image URL,
a preview popup appears automatically after a short hover delay.
.TP
.BR H " or " Esc
Hide popup (suppressed until focus moves to a different URL). Esc also opens the menu.
.TP
.B O
Open the image URL in the default browser.
.TP
.BR < " / " >
Cycle to the previous or next link in the message.
.SH SLASH COMMANDS
.TP
.B /quit
Exit the client.
.TP
.B /join\fR \fIid\fR
Join room by numeric ID.
.TP
.B /rooms
List available rooms in the status bar.
.TP
.B /who
List online users in the status bar.
.TP
.B /history
Fetch older message history.
.SH MENU
Press
.B Esc
to open the menu (when no image preview is open). Use
.BR \(ua / \(da
to navigate and
.B Enter
to select.
.TP
.B Cycle theme
Step through available colour themes:
Dracula, Nord, Gruvbox, Solarized Dark, Tokyo Night, Monokai.
.TP
.B Toggle notifications
Enable or disable desktop notifications and terminal bell.
.TP
.B Image Preview
Toggle inline image preview (persisted to config).
.TP
.B Pick color
Set your username colour (loaded from server).
.TP
.B Logout
Clear saved token and exit.
.TP
.B Quit
Exit without clearing token.
.SH CONFIGURATION
Settings are persisted to
.IR ~/.skychat_tui.json .
.TP
.B username
Pre-fills the login screen.
.TP
.B token
Saved auth token for resuming sessions without re-entering credentials.
.TP
.B theme
Active colour theme. Default:
.IR Dracula .
.TP
.B notifications
Whether desktop notifications are enabled. Default:
.IR true .
.TP
.B image_preview
Whether inline image preview is enabled. Default:
.IR true .
.SH IMAGE PREVIEW
Image preview is auto-detected at startup and disabled gracefully if none of the
following are available:
.TP
.B Kitty
Requires
.B Pillow
and the Kitty terminal emulator. Best quality, no flicker.
.TP
.B Sixel
Requires
.B Pillow
and a Sixel-capable terminal (foot, iTerm2, mlterm). Good quality, minor flicker.
.TP
.B libcaca
Requires
.B img2txt
(from
.BR libcaca-utils )
or the
.B python-caca
bindings. Coloured ASCII art fallback, works in any 256-colour terminal.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.skychat_tui.json
User configuration and saved auth token.
.TP
.I /tmp/skychat_crash.log
Crash traceback written when
.B \-\-debug
is passed.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B ESCDELAY
ncurses ESC disambiguation delay in milliseconds. Automatically set to
.B 25
by the client to reduce latency.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Open the login screen:
.B skychat
.TP
Log in directly:
.B skychat alice hunter2
.TP
Log in with crash logging enabled:
.B skychat alice hunter2 \-\-debug
.SH REQUIREMENTS
Python 3.10 or later.
The
.B websockets
package (installed automatically via pip).
A terminal with 256-colour support.
.SH BUGS
Sixel image preview may flicker on large images due to the nature of the Sixel
protocol interacting with curses repaints. Use Kitty protocol for flicker-free
image display.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR curl (1),
.BR python3 (1)
.PP
SkyChat web client: https://skych.at
